# Send only the files needed to build the application, excluding local credentials.
*
!Dockerfile
!uv.lock
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
# src/** is re-included wholesale above, so anything that lands inside it
# ships in the image. .dockerignore governs the build context, not .gitignore.
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*~
**/.env*
